    "title": "What Siena coach Gerry McNamara said when asked Syracuse basketball",
    "text": "COLLEGEWhy March Madness could be farewell for coach Gerry McNamara with Siena basketball Todd ShanesyGreenville NewsUpdated March 18, 2026, 3:00 p.m. ETSiena basketball coach Gerry McNamara acknowledged but brushed off speculation that he will soon be headed to Syracuse to take over that program. “My full focus is on the team in that locker room,” McNamara said after Siena’s practice time March 18 at Bon Secours Wellness Arena for the Men’s NCAA Tournament. March Madness tickets for Greenville Regional in NCAA TournamentOur team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
